          "text": "{\"blocks\":[{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"The selected award options trade points and cabin against schedule; neither is an overall winner.\"},{\"k\":\"p\",\"r\":\"J63@2027-01-08T08:36-08:00/SFO>BKK/B>2027-01-10T04:15\",\"n\":\"Business award via LAX\",\"v\":\"Consider this if business cabin and an earlier arrival appeal: among these two options, it arrives 4 hours 35 minutes earlier and takes 84 minutes less than the economy option. It requires 275,000 Turkish points.\"},{\"k\":\"p\",\"r\":\"J18@2027-01-08T11:47-08:00/SFO>BKK/E>2027-01-10T08:50\",\"n\":\"Economy award via LAX\",\"v\":\"Consider this if using fewer Turkish points appeals: it requires 110,000 points, 165,000 fewer than the business option, in exchange for a longer trip and later arrival.\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"Both options combine a separately booked SFO–LAX cash leg with an LAX–BKK award. Check whether the separate positioning booking works for you; its booking obligations are unverified. Support for one traveler on the award and award taxes and fees are unconfirmed, and the price scopes for both awards and positioning fares are unknown.\"},{\"k\":\"b\",\"r\":\"C1@2027-01-08T06:05-08:00/SFO>BKK\",\"n\":\"Cash reference\",\"v\":\"The search results show a source quote of USD 452.00 for SFO–BKK; its price scope is unknown.\"}]}",
